Consent
The Platform collects, uses, and discloses personal information only for identified purposes and with appropriate consent, except where permitted or required by law. 【2-d53707】

By creating an account and using the Platform, users consent to the collection, use, disclosure, and retention of personal information as described in this Privacy Policy.

Users may withdraw consent for certain processing activities, subject to legal, operational, security, or contractual limitations.

Withdrawal of consent may impact the availability of Platform services.

Age Verification and Age Assurance
The Platform may use trusted third-party age verification or age assurance providers to support:

Age-Based Access Controls
Teen Environment Access
Adult Environment Access
Age Progression System (APS)
To minimize privacy impacts, the Platform will seek to retain only:

Verification Status
Verified Date Of Birth
Verification Date
Verification Expiration Date
Provider Reference Identifier
The Platform will seek to avoid retaining copies of government-issued identification documents unless legally required or operationally necessary.

Age Progression System (APS)
The Platform includes a future Age Progression System that allows users to transition from Teen Environment access to Adult Environment access when eligible.

APS may process:

Date Of Birth
Verification Status
Verification History
Eligibility Status
Realm Assignment
APS decisions are enforced by backend systems and cannot be modified by users.

Privacy Protections for Teen Users
The Platform provides enhanced privacy protections for users assigned to the Teen Environment.

Additional protections may include:

Restricted Profile Visibility
Enhanced Moderation Oversight
Additional Communication Controls
Limited Public Exposure Of Personal Information
Parental Or Guardian Controls
Additional Abuse Prevention Systems
The Platform seeks to minimize unnecessary collection, use, and disclosure of information relating to teen users.

