Cross-Border Processing and Storage
The Platform may use service providers located in Canada and other jurisdictions.

Personal information may therefore be processed, stored, or accessed outside Canada.

Where information is transferred outside Canada, the Platform remains responsible for protecting personal information and will implement reasonable contractual, technical, and administrative safeguards. PIPEDA continues to apply to Canadian organizations transferring personal information across borders for commercial purposes. 【1-082007】

