Security Monitoring
Backup Systems
Rate Limiting
Administrative Controls
While we work to protect personal information, no security system can guarantee absolute protection.

Security Incidents and Breach Notification
The Platform maintains procedures for identifying, responding to, and documenting security incidents.

Where required by applicable law, affected individuals will be notified when a privacy breach creates a real risk of significant harm.

The Platform will maintain records of security incidents and take reasonable steps to mitigate risks associated with any breach.

